{"id":"wb-6-522","name":"瞻园","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"瞻园","text":"瞻园位于中国江苏省南京市秦淮区夫子庙街道瞻园路208号。瞻园始建于明朝嘉靖年间，是南京现存历史最悠久的私家园林，有“金陵第一园”之称，也和煦园并称为“金陵两大名园”，现已被列入全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9E%BB%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":94390418,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94390418","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ab993f16b731b2682d51ba84.jpg","title":"Nanjing_ZhanYuan1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nanjing_ZhanYuan1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/Nanjing_ZhanYuan1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"日语維基百科的Px820 / http://px820.onmitsu.jp","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"南京瞻园\n瞻園・太平天国歴史博物館 2004年4月15日撮影 撮影者：権作","width":320,"height":240}}